        "alt": "Roast the chunks",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 480,
        "credit": "Illustration based on the printed recipe card"
      }
    },
    {
      "number": 2,
      "id": "step-2",
      "heading": "Prepare the vegetables",
      "blocks": [
        "Deseed the bell pepper and cut it into 2 cm chunks. Halve, peel and wedge the red onion."
      ],
      "notes": [],
      "timers": [],
      "image": {
        "id": "cheesy-pesto-chicken-traybake-2-sketch",
